<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Plutonic reports steady year net.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Plutonic reports steady year net.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>		  (A$ million unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit			37.69 vs 43.68</p>
<p>    Net profit				40.70 vs 40.12</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)		 7.0  vs 5.5</p>
<p>NOTE: Plutonic Resources Ltd is a gold miner and is about 30 percent owned by Malaysia Mining Corp Bhd.  </p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)		11.00 vs 9.5</p>
<p>    Sales				    279.39 vs 211.65</p>
<p>    Other income			    61.07 vs  11.04</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			     21.7  vs  22.3</p>
<p>    Abnormal			 profit 10.08 vs  nil</p>
<p>Dividend is unfranked</p>
<p>Pay date Apr 2</p>
<p>Reg date Mar 19</p>
<p>    Tax					  7.86 vs 3.29</p>
<p>    Interest expense			10.40 vs 1.15</p>
<p>    Depreciation			    48.31 vs 33.30</p>
<p>    Minorities (thousands)	  gain 0.79 vs expense 0.26</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
